  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven : 136 − (176 ÷ 11) × 8 + 22 × 3 = 105\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the numbers :\n\nOption - (1): 11 and 22\n\n136 − (176 ÷ 11) × 8 + 22 × 3 = 105 ⇒ 136 − (176 ÷ 22) × 8 + 11 × 3 = 105\n\n136 − __**(176 ÷ 22)**__ × 8 + 11 × 3 = 105\n\n136 − __8____** × 8 **__+ __**11 × 3**__ = 105\n\n__**136 + 33**__ - 64 = 105\n\n__**169 - 64**__ = 105\n\n**105 = 105 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption - (2): 22 and 176\n\n136 − (176 ÷ 11) × 8 + 22 × 3 = 105 ⇒ 136 − (22 ÷ 11) × 8 + 176 × 3 = 105\n\n136 − __**(22 ÷ 11)**__ × 8 + 176 × 3 = 105\n\n136 − __2____** × 8**__ + __**176 × 3**__ = 105\n\n__**136 + 528**__ - 16 = 105\n\n__**664 - 16**__ = 105\n\n648 ≠ 105 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption - (3): 8 and 11\n\n136 − (176 ÷ 11) × 8 + 22 × 3 = 105 ⇒ 136 − (176 ÷ 8) × 11 + 22 × 3 = 105\n\n136 − __**(176 ÷ 8)**__ × 11 + 22 × 3 = 105\n\n136 - __**22 × 11**__ + __**22 × 3**__ = 105\n\n__**136 + 66**__ - 242 = 105\n\n__**202 - 242**__ = 105\n\n-40 ≠ 105 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption - (4): 8 and 3\n\n136 − (176 ÷ 11) × 8 + 22 × 3 = 105 ⇒ 136 − (176 ÷ 11) × 3 + 22 × 8 = 105\n\n136 − __**(176 ÷ 11)**__ × 3 + 22 × 8 = 105\n\n136 - __**16 × 3**__ + __**22 × 8**__ = 105\n\n__**136 + 176**__ - 48 = 105\n\n__**312 - 48**__ = 105\n\n264 ≠ 105 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (1)\" is the correct answer.",
